    {
      "taskId": "PROMPTEDITOR-20261012-002",
      "title": "Add triple-backtick embedded region creation and collapse",
      "description": "On the RichTextBox foundation from task 001, detect a triple-backtick fence typed or pasted into the prompt editor and convert its contents into a collapsible embedded code region, with a serialization contract that round-trips the region back into a triple-backtick fenced block when the prompt is read.\n\n## Observable outcome\n\nTyping or pasting a triple-backtick fence in the prompt editor creates a visually distinct, collapsible embedded region; collapsing and expanding it works interactively; reading the prompt back out serializes the region into an equivalent triple-backtick fenced block.\n\n## Consumers\n\nTask 003 adds Up/Down caret navigation across these regions. The prompt serialization path (wherever the prompt text is read for submission) consumes the fence output produced here.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nLanguage tagging on a fence is a serialization-contract capability only in this plan: a region may carry an optional language value that is included in the serialized fence, but no interactive language-picker UI ships as part of this task. A full language-selection UI is out of scope and deferred to a future plan.",
      "dependsOn": [
        "PROMPTEDITOR-20261012-001"
      ],
      "priority": "high",
      "status": "complete",
      "commit": "7557739a0e76ba5fbeecce1a4f6bd6c302bfa634",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-13T04:40:00.7398125+00:00",
