      "title": "Add Up/Down boundary navigation across embedded regions",
      "description": "Implement Up/Down arrow-key caret navigation so the caret moves correctly into, through, and out of a collapsed or expanded embedded region at its top and bottom boundaries, rather than getting stuck or jumping unpredictably.\n\n## Observable outcome\n\nPressing Up at the first line below a region moves the caret into the region (or past it, per the region\u0027s current collapsed/expanded state) instead of stalling; pressing Down at the last line above a region behaves symmetrically; navigation past a region lands the caret in the correct adjacent plain-text line.\n\n## Consumers\n\nThis directly extends the embedded-region behavior from task 002 inside the same RichTextBox-based prompt editor; no further downstream task depends on it.",
